schema: "0.4"
id: echo-of-manifestation-character-the-hollow-alchemist
type: image
quality: medium

prompt:
  text: >
    Dark fantasy concept art portrait of the Hollow Alchemist — a male figure consumed by
    shadow, half-materialized between the material world and the Plane of Echoes. His right
    side is still human: pale skin, visible bone structure, a portion of an alchemist's coat.
    His left side dissolves into sentient shadow that moves with its own agency, tendrils of
    darkness reaching outward as if hungry for more substance. Deep alchemical symbols are
    carved into his exposed skin — not tattoos but gouged channels that leak a dark essence
    like liquid shadow, the substance dripping and floating upward in defiance of gravity.
    His expression is manic — eyes too wide, a grin that stretches beyond what a human face
    should allow, caught between ecstasy and agony. One hand reaches toward the viewer while
    the shadow-half attempts to claw its way free from his body. The background is swirling
    dark essence and fragmented transmutation circles. Painterly style, atmospheric lighting,
    body horror elements handled with restraint rather than gore. The mood is tragic
    corruption — someone who pushed transmutation too far and became the experiment.
  negative: "bright, cheerful, cartoon, anime, clean magic, simple villain, generic demon, excessive gore, colorful palette, low detail, flat shading, clean edges"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1024
    height: 1536
    aspect_ratio: "2:3"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.7
  criteria:
    anatomy: {weight: 3, description: "Correct human/creature proportions, no extra limbs or malformed features"}
    prompt_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Key details from prompt present — clothing, expression, distinguishing features"}
    style_consistency: {weight: 2, description: "Dark fantasy painterly style, atmospheric lighting, appropriate color palette"}
    composition: {weight: 1, description: "Portrait framing, subject clearly readable, no cropping issues"}
  reject_if:
    - "extra fingers or limbs"
    - "anime or cartoon style"
    - "bright cheerful palette"

tags: [character, antagonist, hollow-alchemist, corrupted, portrait, concept-art, dark-fantasy, body-horror]
